  <section class="bs" id="safety" aria-labelledby="bs-h"><h2 id="bs-h">Before you start</h2><div class="slider tslider slider--care" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__i">!</span><b>Keep the contacts dry</b><p>The contacts sit at the bottom of the battery bay and on the end of the battery. They never get wet.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-before-contacts.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="mk mk--info mk--c" style="left:32.7%;top:22%"><i></i><span>USB-C port</span></span><span class="mk mk--warn mk--c" style="left:50.0%;top:79%"><i></i><span>Contacts: keep dry</span></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__i">!</span><b>Keep the battery dry</b><p>The battery never goes under water. Everything else rinses from the top, with the battery fitted.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-dry.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__i">!</span><b>Let the battery cool before charging</b><p>After a session the battery is warm. Give it time to cool, then plug it in.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-before-charge.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section>
  <a class="packban" href="#pack"><picture><source media="(max-width:991px)" srcset="{{ 'dm-pdp-bowl-darkwood-m.jpg' | file_url }}"><img src="{{ 'dm-pdp-bowl-darkwood.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Tobacco tipped from a tin into the ceramic cup and its basket"></picture><div><b>Charged? Pack your first cup</b><span>10–15 g in two light layers. Pick your mesh and the steps open right there.</span></div><em>How to pack</em></a>
  <section class="ch" id="out-of-the-box"><p class="ch__num">01 · Start</p><h2>Out of the box</h2><p class="ch__lead">Everything for the first session is in the box, except the hookah, your tobacco and a USB-C wall charger. Here is what each part is and what it is for.</p><div class="boxgrid boxgrid--stack"><div class="box__img"><figure class="bx bx--hero" data-tile="0" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Diamond with thermo cap"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-device-top.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Diamond with thermo cap" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">Diamond with thermo cap</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Ceramic cups"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-cup.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Ceramic cups" loading="lazy"><i class="bx__n">×2</i><figcaption class="bx__t">Ceramic cups</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="2" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Basket mesh"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-basket.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Basket mesh" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">Basket mesh</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Flat mesh screens"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-screens-2.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Flat mesh screens" loading="lazy"><i class="bx__n">×3</i><figcaption class="bx__t">Flat mesh screens</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx bx--s" data-tile="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Long adapter"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-adapter-tall.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Long adapter" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">Long adapter</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx bx--s" data-tile="5" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Short adapter"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-adapter-short.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Short adapter" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">Short adapter</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="6" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Cup removal tool"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-tool.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Cup removal tool" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">Cup removal tool</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx bx--s" data-tile="7" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Cleaning brush"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-brush.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Cleaning brush" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">Cleaning brush</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="8" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="USB-C cable"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-cable.webp' | file_url }}" alt="USB-C cable" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="bx__t">USB-C cable</figcaption></figure><p class="box__cap" aria-live="polite">Tap a part to see what it is</p></div><ul class="boxlist"><li data-tile="0"><em>×1</em><div><b>Diamond</b><span>With the thermo cap fitted and the battery inside.</span></div></li><li data-tile="0"><em>×1</em><div><b>Diamond Battery</b><span>Removable. Charges inside Diamond or on its own. About 90 minutes per charge.</span></div></li><li data-tile="1"><em>×2</em><div><b>Ceramic cups</b><span>The tobacco goes here: one running, one packed and waiting.</span></div></li><li data-tile="2"><em>×1</em><div><b>Basket mesh</b><span>Sits in the cup for a loose, airy pack. Lifts out in one piece to clean.</span></div></li><li data-tile="3"><em>×3</em><div><b>Flat mesh screens</b><span>Lie on the bottom of the cup for a denser pack.</span></div></li><li data-tile="6"><em>×1</em><div><b>Cup removal tool</b><span>Lifts the hot cup out, and turns the plate on the cap.</span></div></li><li data-tile="4"><em>×1</em><div><b>Long adapter</b><span>Seats Diamond on your hookah stem.</span></div></li><li data-tile="5"><em>×1</em><div><b>Short adapter</b><span>The same, for shorter stem tops. Most stems take either.</span></div></li><li data-tile="7"><em>×1</em><div><b>Cleaning brush</b><span>For the shaft and the chamber.</span></div></li><li data-tile="8"><em>×1</em><div><b>USB-C cable</b><span>Charges Diamond or the battery. The wall charger is not in the box.</span></div></li></ul></div><h3>Before you switch it on</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>The latch</b><p>Turn Diamond round. The battery sits behind the black arc latch on the back.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-closed.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Open the latch</b><p>Flip the latch open with a finger.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-open.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Battery out</b><p>Lift the battery out by the latch.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Paper tab off</b><p>Pull the small paper tab off the battery contacts. With it in place Diamond will not switch on.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-contacts.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="mk mk--warn mk--l" style="left:79.3%;top:73%"><i></i><span>Paper tab: pull it off</span></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Back in, latch closed</b><p>With the latch open, set the battery in, contacts down. Then close the latch so the battery is locked in place.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-close.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="charging"><p class="ch__num">02 · Start</p><h2>Charge it first</h2><p class="ch__lead">Give the battery a full charge before the first session. Two ways, both over USB-C. Each of the four dots is a quarter of the charge: all four lit means full, about 1.5 hours from empty.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Battery on its own</b><p>Pull the battery out and plug the cable straight into it. Handy with a spare: one in Diamond, one charging.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-before-charge.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>About 1.5 h · 30 W</b><p>Full in about 1.5 hours with a 30 W USB-C charger. The four dots show the charge in quarters.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-charge-dots.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Or inside Diamond</b><p>Leave the battery in and plug the cable into the port on the back, under the four dots.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-charge-in.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Check the level</b><p>Diamond switched off? One click on the dial shows the charge on the screen.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="level" role="img" aria-label="Check the level: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3 id="charger">Which charger</h3><p class="h3lead">There is no wall charger in the box. Use the USB-C cable from the box with any USB-C wall charger rated 30 W or more, such as a phone fast charger or a laptop charger.</p><div class="cws"><div class="cws__c cws__c--on"><b>30 W or more</b><span>A full charge in about 1.5 hours.</span></div><div class="cws__c"><b>15–29 W</b><span>It charges, just more slowly.</span></div></div><h3>Reading the four dots</h3><div class="dotsanim"><span class="d"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><div><b>Charging</b><small>The dots fill one by one, a quarter each. All four lit: full.</small></div></div><ul class="dots4"><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i></span><b>25 %</b><small>A quarter</small></li><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i></span><b>50 %</b><small>Half</small></li><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class=""></i></span><b>75 %</b><small>Three quarters</small></li><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i></span><b>100 %</b><small>Full, about 1.5 h from empty</small></li></ul><h3 id="charge-while-smoking">Charge while you smoke</h3><div class="cwsx"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-charge-while-smoking.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Diamond on a hookah from the back, a USB-C cable plugged in under the four lit dots" loading="lazy"><div><p class="h3lead">Keep a 30 W USB-C supply plugged into the back and the session runs on. Whether the battery also charges depends on the heat.</p><div class="cws"><div class="cws__c cws__c--on"><b>255 °C or lower</b><span>The battery charges while you smoke.</span></div><div class="cws__c"><b>Above 255 °C</b><span>The cable keeps the session going, but the battery does not charge.</span></div></div><p class="h3lead"><b>After about three hours on the cable,</b> give the battery a rest: take it out for about 20 minutes to cool, then charge it on its own.</p></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="battery"><p class="ch__num">03 · Start</p><h2>Battery</h2><p class="ch__lead">One removable battery runs Diamond. A spare keeps a long evening going: one in Diamond, one charging.</p><div class="temps"><div><b>About 90 min</b><span>Per charge, pre-heat not included</span></div><div><b>About 1.5 h</b><span>From empty to full with a 30 W USB-C charger</span></div></div><h3>When it runs low</h3><div class="temps"><div class=""><b>10 %</b><span>First sound: time to plan</span></div><div class=""><b>4–6 %</b><span>Second sound, and heating stops</span></div><div class="red"><b>2–3 %</b><span>Diamond switches off</span></div></div><h3>Swap it mid-session</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Switch off</b><p>Hold the dial for 3 seconds.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-switch-off-thumb.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Battery out</b><p>Open the latch and lift the battery out.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Charged one in</b><p>Set a charged battery in, contacts down, and close the latch.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-close.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Continue Session?</b><p>Switch on. With the chamber still hot, turn to Yes and click: no new pre-heat.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-continue.png' | file_url }}" alt="Continue Session?: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="the-dial"><p class="ch__num">04 · Start</p><h2>The dial and the screen</h2><p class="ch__lead">One dial does everything: turn to move and to change the temperature, click to choose. No touch screen, no app.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:7"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Hold 3 seconds</b><p>Switches Diamond on, or off.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="hold" role="img" aria-label="Hold 3 seconds: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Turn slowly</b><p>One degree at a time, for a fine adjustment.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="slow" role="img" aria-label="Turn slowly: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Turn fast</b><p>Jumps in fives, to get there quickly.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="fast" role="img" aria-label="Turn fast: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Click</b><p>Chooses. During a session it opens the menu.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="click" role="img" aria-label="Click: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Click twice</b><p>Cancel: turn to Yes and click to stop the session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="click2" role="img" aria-label="Click twice: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">6</span><b>Click four times</b><p>Locks the dial. Four clicks again unlock it.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="click4" role="img" aria-label="Click four times: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">7</span><b>One click when off</b><p>Shows the battery level.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="level" role="img" aria-label="One click when off: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="pack"><p class="ch__num">05 · Start</p><h2>Pack the cup</h2><p class="ch__lead">Two light layers of your usual tobacco. First choose the mesh: it changes the smoke, the pack and the heat.</p><div class="grams"><b>10–15 g</b><span>of your usual tobacco. <b>Mix it first:</b> the juice settles at the bottom of the tin.</span></div><h3>Touching or not: two meshes</h3><p class="h3lead">It is the same craft as packing a bowl for coal. The difference is whether the tobacco touches the hot cup.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:2"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Flat screen: in contact</b><p>The tobacco sits against the cup, like a bowl packed in contact under the coals: a deeper roast, a fuller, denser smoke, and it needs less heat. Fine, dry cuts open up best here, Tangiers for example. A little more work to clean.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-screen.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Basket mesh: off the walls</b><p>The basket holds the tobacco away from the cup: an airy, fluffy pack, a lighter smoke, and it needs more heat. Moist and strong blends feel much smoother. Lifts out in one piece to clean.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-basket-empty.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Pick your mesh, then pack</h3><div class="mpick"><button type="button" class="mpick__c on" data-mesh="basket" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="pack-basket"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-basket.webp' | file_url }}" alt=""><b>Basket mesh</b><dl><div><dt>Smoke</dt><dd>Lighter and airy</dd></div><div><dt>Pack</dt><dd>Loose and fluffy, pressed just a little</dd></div><div><dt>Heat</dt><dd>Needs more: set the dial higher</dd></div><div><dt>Cleaning</dt><dd>Easy: lifts out in one piece</dd></div></dl><span class="mpick__open">How to pack it</span></button><div class="mpane on" id="pack-basket"><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Basket in the cup</b><p>Set the basket mesh in the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-basket-empty.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>First layer</b><p>Lay in about half of the 10–15 g, loosely.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-layer1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Press just a little</b><p>Press it down gently with a pick. Keep it airy.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-press.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Second layer</b><p>The rest on top, the same blend or another flavour, pressed just a little again.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-layer2.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>To the edge</b><p>Stop at the edge of the mesh. Then set the dial a little higher.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-filled.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div><button type="button" class="mpick__c" data-mesh="flat" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pack-flat"><img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-screens-2.webp' | file_url }}" alt=""><b>Flat screen</b><dl><div><dt>Smoke</dt><dd>Fuller and denser</dd></div><div><dt>Pack</dt><dd>Even layers, pressed lightly</dd></div><div><dt>Heat</dt><dd>Needs less: more contact with the cup</dd></div><div><dt>Cleaning</dt><dd>More work: brush the screen and the cup</dd></div></dl><span class="mpick__open">How to pack it</span></button><div class="mpane" id="pack-flat"><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Screen on the bottom</b><p>Lay the flat screen on the bottom of the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-screen.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>First layer</b><p>Lay in about half of the 10–15 g, evenly, and press lightly.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-layer1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Second layer</b><p>The rest on top, pressed lightly.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-layer2.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>To the brim</b><p>Stop at the small tab of the cup. Then set the dial a little lower.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-packed.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div></div><h3>Mix in layers</h3><div class="pk-heatmap">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 360 310" role="img" aria-label="The ENSŌ Diamond cup in section: heat comes from the sides and from below, strongest at the bottom">
        <defs><linearGradient id="hg" x1="0" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e2614c"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#e7a35a"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f3dfb8"/></linearGradient></defs>
        
        <path d="M24 52Q24 66 40 68Q78 74 84 96L84 214Q84 248 118 248L160 248L160 272L200 272L200 248L242 248Q276 248 276 214L276 96Q282 74 320 68Q336 66 336 52Z" fill="#1d1b19"/>
        <path d="M44 56Q86 60 98 86L98 210Q98 234 122 234L238 234Q262 234 262 210L262 86Q274 60 316 56Z" fill="url(#hg)" opacity=".94"/>
        <rect x="172" y="234" width="16" height="30" fill="#1d1b19"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="146" x2="260" y2="146" stroke="#1d1b19" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
        <text x="180" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-weight="800" font-size="17" fill="#3a2a10">Accent</text>
        <text x="180" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-weight="800" font-size="17" fill="#fff">Main flavour</text>
        <g stroke="#e2614c" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"><path class="hu" d="M120 306v-18m0 0-6 7m6-7 6 7"/><path class="hu" d="M240 306v-18m0 0-6 7m6-7 6 7"/><path class="hl" d="M30 130h22m0 0-7-6m7 6-7 6"/><path class="hl" d="M30 196h22m0 0-7-6m7 6-7 6"/><path class="hr" d="M330 130h-22m0 0 7-6m-7 6 7 6"/><path class="hr" d="M330 196h-22m0 0 7-6m-7 6 7 6"/></g>
      </svg>
      <div><p class="pk-lead" style="margin:0">Diamond heats the cup from the sides and from below at the same time; the tobacco at the bottom gets it most. So the bottom layer is your main flavour and opens first, and the top layer is the accent that comes through as the cup warms. Two flavours are plenty.</p></div>
    </div><h3>By tobacco</h3><div class="pk-cards">
      <article><img class="pk-cardimg" src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-filled.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="A cup packed with blonde leaf tobacco"><h3>Virginia, blonde leaf</h3><p class="pk-eg">Starline, Fumari, Adalya</p><p>Pre-heat 7 minutes at about 255 °C, then turn it down as the session goes.</p>
        <p class="pk-tip">Very minty or perfumed blends: less heat, around 235 °C, and let the cup open up over time.</p></article>
      <article><img class="pk-cardimg" src="{{ 'dm-s-dark-leaf-packed.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="A cup packed with dark leaf tobacco"><h3>Burley, dark leaf</h3><p class="pk-eg">Darkside, MustHave, BlackBurn</p><p>Pack it airy in the basket mesh. Pre-heat 7 minutes, like every blend; the strongest like it at up to 290 °C.</p>
        <p class="pk-tip">Try Oracle, the fourth profile.</p></article>
      
    </div><h3>Into the chamber</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Cap off</b><p>Lift the cap off by its rubber pads. The chamber is empty.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-chamber-empty.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Cup in</b><p>Set the packed cup straight into the chamber before you switch on. Do not press it down.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-in-by-hand.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Cap on</b><p>Put the cap back on, holding it by the rubber pads.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-on-press-pad.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3 id="cup-tool">Out, swap, clean: the cup tool</h3><p class="h3lead">The fork only takes the cup out: to clean, to change the cup mid-session, when the taste fades or the tobacco is spent. Its other end turns the plate on the cap, see <a href="#the-cap">The cap and the draw</a>.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Fork under the brim</b><p>Slide the fork under the brim of the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-tool-seated.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Lift it straight out</b><p>Lift straight up. The cup is hot: set it down on a heat-safe surface.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-tool-lower.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Next cup in</b><p>Swapping? Set the next packed cup in and close the cap.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-seated-tool-off.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><p class="more"><a href="packing.html">The packing guide: tobaccos, mixes and heat ›</a></p></section><section class="ch" id="on-your-hookah"><p class="ch__num">06 · Start</p><h2>On your hookah</h2><p class="ch__lead">Diamond sits where the bowl sits. Your stem, base and hose stay as they are.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Adapter on, half-way</b><p>Push one of the two adapters onto your hookah stem, only half-way. Do not push it all the way down.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-hookah-adapter-two-hands.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Diamond on top, then press</b><p>Set Diamond on the adapter and press down with both hands: they slide down the stem together for the firmest grip.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-hookah-mount-two-hands.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Ready</b><p>Your hookah, hose and base stay the same. Only the bowl and the coals are gone.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-on-hookah-front.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="switch-on"><p class="ch__num">07 · Every session</p><h2>Pre-heat and temperature</h2><p class="ch__lead">You choose how long Diamond warms the cup and how hot you smoke. The two belong together.</p><span id="temperature" class="anchor"></span><div class="feat feat--mac"><div class="mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="timer" role="img" aria-label="Setting the pre-heat time, minute by minute"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div><h3>Pre-heat time</h3><p>Diamond warms the tobacco before the first draw, so the cup is ready when you are. 7 minutes at 275 °C is the standard; set it in whole minutes, up to 15. 5 minutes at a higher heat gives an intense start, but the flavour fades sooner.</p></div></div><h3>Find your heat</h3><div class="hf2"><div class="mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="ENSŌ Diamond, front"><div class="lv" role="img" aria-label="The dial set to your heat"></div></div></div><div class="hf__q"><div class="hf__g"><b>Your tobacco</b><div class="hf__opts"><button type="button" data-hf="leaf" data-v="virginia" aria-pressed="true">Virginia<small>Blonde leaf</small></button><button type="button" data-hf="leaf" data-v="dark" aria-pressed="false">Burley<small>Dark leaf, heavier</small></button><button type="button" data-hf="leaf" data-v="mix" aria-pressed="false">A mix<small>Virginia and dark</small></button></div></div><div class="hf__g"><b>How you like it</b><div class="hf__opts"><button type="button" data-hf="str" data-v="soft" aria-pressed="true">Lighter<small>Smooth and long</small></button><button type="button" data-hf="str" data-v="strong" aria-pressed="false">Stronger<small>More body</small></button></div></div><dl class="hf2__out" aria-live="polite"><div><dt>Pre-heat</dt><dd class="hf2__pre"></dd></div><div><dt>Session heat</dt><dd class="hf2__t"></dd></div><div><dt>Profile to try</dt><dd class="hf2__prof"></dd></div></dl><p class="hf2__note">A starting point. Turn the dial by taste: the harder you draw, the more heat you need.</p></div></div><h3>On the dial</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Set the time</b><p>Pre-heat Timer → click, turn to set up to 15 minutes, click to save.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="timer" role="img" aria-label="Set the time: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Start</b><p>Start Pre-heat → click. The screen counts down.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="start" role="img" aria-label="Start: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Set the temperature</b><p>While it counts down, turn the dial: 180–320 °C. A sound tells you the session has started.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="temp" role="img" aria-label="Set the temperature: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Adjust in the session</b><p>Turn the dial any time to go warmer or cooler. Turn fast and it jumps in fives.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="session" role="img" aria-label="Adjust in the session: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Stop</b><p>Click twice, turn to Yes, click. Works during pre-heat and during the session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="stop" role="img" aria-label="Stop: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><p class="more"><a href="#profiles">Profiles: a starting heat for each kind of blend ›</a></p><div class="note note--tip"><b>What Diamond remembers</b><ul><li>The pre-heat time and the pre-heat temperature are saved to the profile you are on.</li><li>Turning the temperature during the session changes this session only.</li></ul></div><div class="note note--tip"><b>No auto-off</b><ul><li>The session runs until you switch off, or until the battery runs low.</li></ul></div><h3 id="break">Pause the session</h3><div class="feat feat--mac"><div class="mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="brk" role="img" aria-label="Turning the dial down to 180 °C"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div><p>Turn the dial down to 180 °C. Diamond keeps the cup warm without burning the tobacco, so you can step away for up to 15 minutes. Back again? Turn up to your heat.</p></div></div><h3 id="burnt">If it starts to taste burnt</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Turn the dial down</b><p>Ten or twenty degrees is enough.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="down" role="img" aria-label="Turn the dial down: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Cap off, let it breathe</b><p>Lift the cap by its pads. Blow gently over the tobacco, or simply let it breathe for a moment.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-off.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Or lift the cup</b><p>You can also lift the cup out with the tool for a moment and let it breathe.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-tool-lower.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Back in, cap on</b><p>The flavour comes back: on Diamond it is hard to really burn a cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-on-press-pad.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="profiles"><p class="ch__num">08 · Every session</p><h2>Profiles</h2><p class="ch__lead">Four profiles, each with its own colour. Default always starts the same; the other three keep what you set last. The one you pick stays selected until you pick another.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:6"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Menu › Profiles</b><p>Open Menu, turn to Profiles and click.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-m-profiles.png' | file_url }}" alt="Menu › Profiles: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Pick one</b><p>Turn through the four, click to choose. A tick marks the one in use.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-profiles.png' | file_url }}" alt="Pick one: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Default: room to play</b><p>Always starts at 7 minutes and 275 °C, the middle of the dial, so you can turn up or down for your blend. Nothing is saved.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-profile_default.png' | file_url }}" alt="Default: room to play: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Phoenix: Virginia</b><p>For blonde leaf: a slightly longer pre-heat at a gentler heat, 8 minutes at 265 °C. Keeps what you set last.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-profile_phoenix.png' | file_url }}" alt="Phoenix: Virginia: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Wraith: dark, balanced</b><p>A rounded, balanced flavour for dark blends, 9 minutes at 275 °C. Keeps what you set last.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-profile_wraith.png' | file_url }}" alt="Wraith: dark, balanced: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">6</span><b>Oracle: the smokiest</b><p>For the densest, smokiest session, 8 minutes at 290 °C. Keeps what you set last.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-profile_oracle.png' | file_url }}" alt="Oracle: the smokiest: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><div class="note note--tip"><b>What is kept after a session</b><ul><li>Default: nothing. It starts at 7 minutes and 275 °C every time.</li><li>Phoenix, Wraith and Oracle: the pre-heat time and the pre-heat temperature you set last.</li><li>Turning the temperature during a session changes that session only, on every profile.</li><li>The theme colour you choose is kept with the profile.</li></ul></div></section><section class="ch" id="menu"><p class="ch__num">09 · Every session</p><h2>Menu and settings</h2><p class="ch__lead">Open Menu from the start list, or with one click during a session. Turn to an item, click to open, turn to change, click to confirm. Nothing here stops a running session.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:8"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Menu</b><p>Turn to Menu in the start list and click, or click once during a session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-q-menu.png' | file_url }}" alt="Menu: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Profiles</b><p>Default, Phoenix, Wraith or Oracle. The tick marks the one in use.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-profiles.png' | file_url }}" alt="Profiles: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Theme Color</b><p>Six colours: Ember, Amber, Copper, Moss, Plum and Ash. Kept with the profile.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-theme.png' | file_url }}" alt="Theme Color: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Sound Volume</b><p>From silent to full. Two sounds only: pre-heat done, and battery low.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-volume.png' | file_url }}" alt="Sound Volume: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Haptic Feedback</b><p>The small click under your finger as you turn. Five strengths, or off.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-haptic.png' | file_url }}" alt="Haptic Feedback: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">6</span><b>Brightness</b><p>How bright the screen is. Lower it for a dark room.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-brightness.png' | file_url }}" alt="Brightness: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">7</span><b>Session Screen</b><p>Temperature and time, or a calm animation. Switch any time.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-screen.png' | file_url }}" alt="Session Screen: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">8</span><b>Session Stats</b><p>How many sessions this Diamond has run. One counts after five minutes past pre-heat.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><img class="lvimg" src="{{ 'dm-ui-p-stats.png' | file_url }}" alt="Session Stats: the Diamond screen"></div></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="software"><p class="ch__num">10 · Every session</p><h2>Software updates</h2><p class="ch__lead">Diamond updates over USB-C from your browser. No app to install, no account. Every Diamond leaves us with the latest software.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Plug into your computer</b><p>Take the battery out and plug the cable into the USB-C port at the top of the bay. The other end goes into your computer.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cable-alone.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Open the firmware page</b><p>Open the firmware page on ensoshisha.eu in your browser. It sees Diamond on the cable. Press Update.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mock"><svg class="fwm" viewBox="0 0 400 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" font-family="Montserrat,sans-serif"><rect x="20" y="70" width="360" height="300" rx="16" fill="#fff" stroke="#d9d6d0" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M20 86a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h328a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v26H20z" fill="#F3F1ED"/><circle cx="42" cy="91" r="5" fill="#e2614c"/><circle cx="58" cy="91" r="5" fill="#e7a35a"/><circle cx="74" cy="91" r="5" fill="#7eae82"/><rect x="100" y="82" width="230" height="18" rx="9" fill="#fff"/><text x="215" y="95" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#8E8A85">ensoshisha.eu/firmware</text><text x="200" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#1A1A1A">ENSŌ Diamond software</text><rect x="96" y="186" width="208" height="40" rx="20" fill="#eef5ef"/><circle cx="122" cy="206" r="8" fill="#2e7d4f"/><path d="M118 206l3 3 5-6" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="212" y="211" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#1A1A1A">Diamond connected</text><rect x="120" y="262" width="160" height="46" rx="23" fill="#000"/><text x="200" y="290" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.5" fill="#fff">UPDATE</text><rect x="115" y="257" width="170" height="56" rx="28" fill="none" stroke="#c8943a" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M0 380h400l-24 26H24z" fill="#d9d6d0"/></svg></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Wait until it is done</b><p>Keep the cable in until the page says it is done. Then unplug and put the battery back.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mock"><svg class="fwm" viewBox="0 0 400 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" font-family="Montserrat,sans-serif"><rect x="20" y="70" width="360" height="300" rx="16" fill="#fff" stroke="#d9d6d0" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M20 86a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h328a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v26H20z" fill="#F3F1ED"/><circle cx="42" cy="91" r="5" fill="#e2614c"/><circle cx="58" cy="91" r="5" fill="#e7a35a"/><circle cx="74" cy="91" r="5" fill="#7eae82"/><rect x="100" y="82" width="230" height="18" rx="9" fill="#fff"/><text x="215" y="95" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#8E8A85">ensoshisha.eu/firmware</text><text x="200" y="170" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#1A1A1A">Updating…</text><rect x="80" y="200" width="240" height="12" rx="6" fill="#E6E3DE"/><rect x="80" y="200" width="156" height="12" rx="6" fill="#c8943a"/><text x="200" y="246" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="#666">Keep the cable in until it says done</text><rect x="128" y="276" width="144" height="40" rx="20" fill="#eef5ef"/><text x="200" y="301" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#2e7d4f">Done ✓</text><path d="M0 380h400l-24 26H24z" fill="#d9d6d0"/></svg></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Check the version</b><p>Switch Diamond off and click the dial <b>five times</b>: the version shows on the screen.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="ver" role="img" aria-label="Check the version: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><div class="note note--tip"><b>Hear about the next release</b><ul><li>Turn on update alerts in the ENSŌ app and you get one short message when new software is out. <a href="app.html#diamond-updates">Update alerts ›</a></li></ul></div><p class="tsmore"><a class="tsmore__b" href="app.html#diamond-updates">Open Software updates</a><span>The latest release, how to update and alerts</span></p></section><section class="ch" id="the-cap"><p class="ch__num">11 · Every session</p><h2>The cap and the draw</h2><p class="ch__lead">The thermo cap holds the heat over the cup. The plate on top sets how much air reaches the blend.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Three parts</b><p>The shell that holds the heat, the plate that sets the draw, and the insert that holds them.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-parts-white.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:contain!important;background:#fff"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Five positions</b><p>Four open settings and fully closed. Closed there is no draw. Turn it with the cup tool, even during a session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-plate-fork-macro.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Where to start</b><p>Fully open, all four holes free. Start there and close it a step only if you want a denser draw.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-holes.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Lift by the pads</b><p>Hold the cap only by its rubber side pads and lift it straight up. It is hot during a session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-off.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Cap on</b><p>Set it back flush and press on the rubber pad, never on the hot top.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-on-press-pad.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section><section class="ch" id="cleaning"><p class="ch__num">12 · Care</p><h2>Cleaning</h2><p class="ch__lead">The heating element never clogs: it stays clean, that is the whole idea of Diamond. Only the cup, the mesh, the cap and the shaft need a rinse.</p><h3>After every session: the cup</h3><p class="h3lead">Only the cup and the mesh need it every time. Give Diamond 20–30 minutes to cool first.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Let it cool, then lift it out</b><p>After 20–30 minutes, slide the fork under the brim and lift the cup straight out.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-01-lift-cup-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Loosen around the edge</b><p>Flat screen: run the tip of the fork around the inside edge of the cup so the tobacco comes away from the wall. Basket: lift the basket out first and run the fork around its edge the same way.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-00b-loosen-edge.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Push it out from below</b><p>Then push from below, through the hole in the bottom, with the tool. The tobacco comes out with the screen or the basket.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-02-push-mesh-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Out in one piece</b><p>The tobacco comes out with the mesh. Tip it into the bin and pull the last bits off the mesh.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-03-out-in-one-piece.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Wash the cup and the mesh</h3><p class="h3lead">Warm water and a normal sponge. The same for the cup, the basket and the flat screens.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Rinse</b><p>Rinse the cup and the mesh under warm running water.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-04-rinse.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Sponge or steel scrubber</b><p>Run a sponge over the inside of the cup and over the mesh. A steel scrubber pad takes off anything that sticks.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-05-scrubber.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Stuck? Soak it</b><p>Leave the cup and the mesh in warm water for a while, then sponge again. The dishwasher works, but we do not recommend it: the ceramic gets more brittle.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-06-soak.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><a class="cl-glove" href="../partner-v2/product.html#x-glove"><img src="{{ 'dm-acc-cleaning-glove-1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="The ENSŌ Cleaning Glove"><span><b>Quicker with the ENSŌ Cleaning Glove</b>Its steel mesh palm cleans the cup, the basket and the screens in a few strokes.<em>See the Cleaning Glove ›</em></span></a><h3>The cap</h3><p class="h3lead">No electronics in the cap: all three parts go under the tap.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:1"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Rinse all three parts</b><p>The shell, the plate and the insert. Let them dry fully before the next session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-parts-rinse.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Every few sessions: the shaft</h3><p class="h3lead">The heating element never clogs. The shaft below it gets a brush and a rinse every few sessions. Always with the battery in.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Battery in, latch closed</b><p>Give Diamond an hour to an hour and a half to cool, then lift the cap off. Leave the battery in with the latch closed the whole time: it closes the bay so no water reaches the contacts.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-capoff-back-brush.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Brush the shaft</b><p>Push the cleaning brush through the shaft from the top.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-clean-shaft-brush.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Rinse from the top</b><p>A gentle stream from the top only, the battery fitted. Let everything dry fully.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-ok-rinse-shaft.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Never</h3><p class="h3lead">The battery and the contacts never get wet.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid slider--never" style="--n:2"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>No water in the battery bay</b><p>Rinse from the top only, with the battery fitted.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-bay.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Keep the battery dry</b><p>The battery never goes under water. Neither does the body, or into a dishwasher.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-battery.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><p class="sp-label">Makes it quicker</p><div class="spares"><a class="spare" href="../partner-v2/product.html#e-multitool"><img src="{{ 'dm-acc-multi-tool-1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt=""><span><b>ENSŌ Multi-Tool</b><small>For cleaning and packing</small></span><em>€19.99</em></a></div></section><section class="ch" id="travel"><p class="ch__num">13 · Care</p><h2>Travel and flights</h2><p class="ch__lead">The battery is well under the 100 Wh carry-on limit. Its rating is printed on the battery label.</p><div class="temps"><div><b>56 Wh</b><span>15,150 mAh · 3.7 V · 56.055 Wh, on the label</span></div><div><b>Cabin bag</b><span>The battery travels with you, never in checked luggage</span></div><div><b>Either bag</b><span>Diamond itself, without the battery, can go in checked luggage</span></div></div><div class="note note--tip"><b>Before you fly</b><ul><li>Take the battery out and pack it in your cabin bag.</li><li>Airlines set their own rules: check yours before you travel.</li></ul></div></section><section class="ch" id="donts"><p class="ch__num">14 · Care</p><h2>Keep it safe</h2><p class="ch__lead">Diamond is easy to live with. Water on the battery or its contacts is the one thing it really does not like.</p><div class="safe"><div class="safe__row"><h3>Water and the contacts</h3><div class="safe__pair"><figure class="safe__no"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-bay.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><i>✕</i><b>Don’t</b><span>Water into the battery bay</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="safe__ok"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-ok-rinse-shaft.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><i>✓</i><b>Do</b><span>Rinse the chamber from the top, battery fitted</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="safe__row"><h3>The battery</h3><div class="safe__pair"><figure class="safe__no"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-battery.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><i>✕</i><b>Don’t</b><span>Water over the battery</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="safe__ok"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-before-charge.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><i>✓</i><b>Do</b><span>Dry, and charged once it has cooled</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="safe__row"><h3>Cooling down</h3><div class="safe__pair"><figure class="safe__no"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-covered-soft.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><i>✕</i><b>Don’t</b><span>Covered up on a sofa</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="safe__ok"><img src="{{ 'dm-s-on-hookah-front.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><figcaption><i>✓</i><b>Do</b><span>In the open, on a hard surface</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="note note--dont"><b>If water gets in</b><ul><li>Do not switch Diamond on. Let it cool down and dry out completely.</li><li>Water on the contacts or inside the body is not covered by the warranty.</li></ul></div></section><section class="ch" id="troubleshooting"><p class="ch__num">15 · Help</p><h2>Troubleshooting</h2><p class="ch__lead">Most things are one step away.</p><h3>Power and battery</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>Diamond does not switch on</summary><p>Check that the paper tab is off the battery contacts, that the battery sits in with the latch closed and that it is charged. Then hold the dial for 3 seconds.</p></details><details><summary>Heating stopped mid-session</summary><p>The battery reached about 2–3 %. Plug in USB-C, or switch off and fit a charged battery. <b>Continue Session?</b> picks up where you were.</p></details><details><summary>Continue Session? did not appear</summary><p>It only shows while the chamber is still hot. If it has cooled, start a new pre-heat.</p></details><details><summary>The battery does not charge</summary><p>Let it cool first. Use a 30 W USB-C supply, try another cable, or charge the battery on its own.</p></details></div><h3>Flavour and smoke</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>Weak flavour, little smoke</summary><p>Go up 10 °C, open the plate a step, pack a little denser or pre-heat a minute longer.</p></details><details><summary>Harsh or burnt taste</summary><p>Turn the dial down, lift the cap off, blow gently over the tobacco and let it cool for a moment, then cap back on. Next time pack looser, or try the basket mesh.</p></details><details><summary>A smell from the last session</summary><p>Rinse the chamber from the top and brush the shaft, then let it dry fully.</p></details></div><h3>Fit and draw</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>No draw at all</summary><p>The plate is fully closed: turn it open a step. Also check the adapter and the hookah seals.</p></details><details><summary>Diamond wobbles on the stem</summary><p>Take it off, set the adapter only half-way onto the stem, put Diamond on top and press: they slide down together and sit firm. Still loose? Try the other adapter.</p></details><details><summary>The cup will not come out</summary><p>Let Diamond cool. Twist the cup gently, carefully so it does not crack. Still stuck? Press lightly around the rim to rock it loose, then lift it out with the tool.</p></details></div><h3>Screen and settings</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>The dial turns but nothing changes</summary><p>It is locked: a lock shows on the screen. Click four times.</p></details><details><summary>The screen is too dark or too bright</summary><p>Menu › Brightness.</p></details><details><summary>No sound when pre-heat finishes</summary><p>Menu › Sound Volume: it may be at zero.</p></details><details><summary>My settings look different</summary><p>Check which profile is on: the colour and the dots at the bottom tell you. Menu › Profiles to switch back.</p></details><details><summary>Which firmware do I have?</summary><p>With Diamond switched off, click the dial <b>five times</b>. The version shows on the screen.</p></details><details><summary>Back to factory settings</summary><p>With Diamond switched off, click <b>seven times and hold</b>. Profiles and settings return to how they left the factory.</p></details></div><p class="tsmore"><a class="tsmore__b" href="/pages/enso-diamond-app#diamond-fix">Open the full troubleshooter</a><span>Step by step, for every problem</span></p></section><section class="ch" id="warranty"><p class="ch__num">16 · Help</p><h2>Warranty and support</h2><p class="ch__lead">Two years on Diamond, one year on the battery.</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@ensoshisha.eu">support@ensoshisha.eu</a> with your order number and a short description or a photo. <a href="../partner-v2/warranty.html">Read the warranty terms →</a></p></section>

